Package: sfg-apt-source
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: SFG Autonomous Systems <projekt-sfg-autonomous-systems@hs-esslingen.de>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: ca-certificates
Description: APT source and signing key for the SFG Autonomous Systems repository.
 Installs the repository signing keyring and a deb822 APT source for the SFG
 APT repository. Depends on ca-certificates, because the repository is served
 over HTTPS.
